  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1502.87 Well production volume",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1502.87 “Well production volume” means the maximum daily volume produced by or approved for production by a public water supply well and used by the department as the basis for determining the sanitary protective radius for the well.\n\nSource. #9343, eff 1-1-09; ss by #12342, eff 8-15-17 (formerly Env-Wq 1502.76); ss by #14472, eff 1-19-26, EXPIRES: 1-19-36; renumbered by #14656, eff 8-6-26, EXPIRES: 8-6-36 (formerly Env-Wq 1502.84)",
